Third-party components

This repository redistributes theme configuration files only. It does not
bundle the third-party assets it references; those are installed separately on
your system:

  - Papirus icon theme (icons, including folder SVGs)
      https://github.com/PapirusDevelopmentTeam/papirus-icon-theme
      GPL-2.0-or-later -- installed via the `papirus-icon-theme` package

  - papirus-folders helper (folder colour switching script)
      https://github.com/PapirusDevelopmentTeam/papirus-folders
      MIT -- installed via the `papirus-folders` package

  - Catppuccin Macchiato colour palette
      https://github.com/catppuccin
      MIT -- referenced by this theme's colour tokens

  - Catppuccin cursors
      https://github.com/catppuccin/cursors
      MIT -- installed via the `catppuccin-cursors-macchiato` package

The `Stylus.json` userstyle list links to third-party stylesheets that remain
under their own authors' licences.
